# Source billsheet scans — contain PHI (patient name, MRN, DOB). Kept local
# only; the dashboard links to them but they must never be committed/deployed.
# Dropped next to preview.html (recon/) and/or in recon/billsheets/.
recon/*.jpg
recon/*.jpeg
recon/*.png
# Reconciliation export — has patient name + MRN. (Only top-level recon/*.csv;
# the source contract price list under recon/source/ stays tracked.)
recon/*.csv
recon/billsheets/*
!recon/billsheets/README.md
# Self-contained dashboard with those scans embedded — also PHI, local only.
recon/preview.local.html

